<title>JAPAN: Sokkia - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sokkia - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.32		vs	   10.27</p>
<p> Operating	  246    million    vs	  413    million</p>
<p> Current	    469    million    vs	  823    million</p>
<p> Net		  107    million    vs	  364    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.88 yen	  vs	   13.20 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sokkia Co Ltd is a manufacturer of surveying instruments.</p>
